  {
   "text": {
    "*": [
     {
      "k": "h4",
      "lines": [
       [
        "Entrance Antiphon"
       ]
      ],
      "cite": "Cf. Ps. 132:9"
     }
    ]
   },
   "part": "entranceAntiphon"
  },
  {
   "text": {
    "*": [
     {
      "k": "p",
      "lines": [
       [
        "Your priests, O Lord, shall be clothed with justice; your holy ones shall ring out their joy."
       ]
      ]
     }
    ]
   },
   "part": "entranceAntiphon"
  },
  {
   "text": {
    "*": [
     {
      "k": "h4",
      "lines": [
       [
        "Collect"
       ]
      ]
     }
    ]
   },
   "part": "collect"
  },
  {
   "text": {
    "*": [
     {
      "k": "p",
      "lines": [
       [
        "O God, who joined the apostolic zeal of a pastor"
       ],
       [
        "to the way of life of a monk in Blessed Cyprian Michael;"
       ],
       [
        "grant us, by his intercession, that persevering in prayer,"
       ],
       [
        "we may seek untiringly the coming of your kingdom."
       ],
       [
        "Through our Lord Jesus Christ, your Son,"
       ],
       [
        "who lives and reigns with you in the unity of the Holy Spirit,"
       ],
       [
        "one God, for ever and ever."
       ]
      ]
     }
    ]
   },
   "part": "collect"
  },
  {
   "text": {
    "*": [
     {
      "k": "h4",
      "lines": [
       [
        "Prayer over the Offerings"
       ]
      ]
     }
    ]
   },
   "part": "prayerOverOfferings"
  },
  {
   "text": {
    "*": [
     {
      "k": "p",
      "lines": [
       [
        "Receive, O Lord, we pray,"
       ],
       [
        "the offerings placed on your altar"
       ],
       [
        "in commemoration of blessed Cyprian Michael,"
       ],
       [
        "so that as you brought him glory"
       ],
       [
        "you may, through these sacred mysteries,"
       ],
       [
        "grant to us your pardon."
       ],
       [
        "Through Christ our Lord."
       ]
      ]
     }
    ]
   },
   "part": "prayerOverOfferings"
  },
  {
